[30.385404, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n\u001b[1m# 5. From a device on the tailnet: ask agent \"demo-093339\" to refund an order through the MCP server\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  no API key and no OAuth: WireGuard identifies the caller, a grant carries the tools\u001b[0m\r\n"]
